* Flyback Isolated DC-DC | Vin: +/-12V to +/-50V | Vout: +12V Regulated (Isolated)
* UNPLUGGED Hardware Hackathon - Team Electrabuzz
* Brownie Points Challenge: Polarity-Independent Isolated Power Interface

.param Vin_value=24
.param Rload_value=48
.options gmin=1e-9 reltol=0.003 cshunt=1e-15

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 1: INPUT SOURCE + SURGE PROTECTION
* ==============================================================================
* DC input voltage source (sweep +/-12V, +/-24V, +/-36V, +/-50V)
V1 inp 0 {Vin_value}

* Fuse resistance (models PCB trace / wire resistance)
R_fuse inp in_fused 0.05

* Bidirectional TVS surge protection (clamps at 55V peak)
D_tvs1 in_fused tvs_mid D_TVS
D_tvs2 0 tvs_mid D_TVS
.model D_TVS D(BV=55 IBV=5m Rs=0.5)
R_tvs_bleed tvs_mid 0 10Meg

* Input EMI filter capacitor
C_in in_fused 0 100u ic=0

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 2: FULL BRIDGE RECTIFIER
* ==============================================================================
* Schottky bridge ensures positive rectified output for ANY input polarity
* Vin > 0: D1+D4 conduct | Vin < 0: D2+D3 conduct
* Result: V(rect_p) - V(rect_n) = |Vin| - 0.6V (two Schottky drops)
D1 in_fused rect_p DSCHOTTKY
D2 0 rect_p DSCHOTTKY
D3 rect_n in_fused DSCHOTTKY
D4 rect_n 0 DSCHOTTKY
.model DSCHOTTKY D(Is=1e-5 Rs=0.03 N=1.05 BV=60 Vj=0.3 Cjo=100p)

* Rectifier ground reference (avoids floating node warning in SPICE)
R_rect_ref rect_n 0 10Meg
C_rect rect_p rect_n 47u ic={abs(Vin_value)}

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 3: POLARITY DETECTION (0V = Normal / 5V = Reversed)
* ==============================================================================
* Resistive divider senses ORIGINAL input (before bridge rectifier)
* Normal polarity (Vin > 0): v_sense > 2.5V ref --> pol_out = 0V
* Reversed polarity (Vin < 0): v_sense < 2.5V ref --> pol_out = 5V
R1_sense in_fused v_sense 90k
R2_sense v_sense 0 10k
V_5v vcc_5v rect_n 5
V_ref v_ref rect_n 2.5

* Behavioral comparator output + conditioning
B_comp pol_raw rect_n V=if(V(v_sense)<V(v_ref,rect_n), 5, 0)
R_hyst pol_raw v_sense 1Meg
R_pol_cond pol_raw pol_out 1k
D_clamp pol_out rect_n D_ZENER5V1
.model D_ZENER5V1 D(BV=5.1 IBV=1m)
R_pd pol_out rect_n 100k

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 4: FLYBACK DC-DC (Galvanic Isolation)
* ==============================================================================
* --- TRANSFORMER (Coupled Inductors) ---
* L_pri: Primary winding (rect_p to drain)
* L_sec: Secondary winding (iso_gnd to sec) - dot at iso_gnd
* Turns ratio: N = sqrt(L_sec/L_pri) = sqrt(144/100) = 1.2
* Step-up ratio ensures Vout_raw > 12V at minimum 12V input
L_pri rect_p drain 100u
L_sec iso_gnd sec 144u
K1 L_pri L_sec 0.95

* --- Primary Side MOSFET Switch ---
M1 drain gate rect_n rect_n NMOSFET
.model NMOSFET NMOS(VTO=2 KP=100 RD=0.01 RS=0.01)
V_pwm gate rect_n PULSE(0 12 0 20n 20n 4.5u 10u)

* --- Snubber & Secondary Rectification ---
* RCD clamp snubber absorbs leakage inductance voltage spike
D_snub drain snub_node DFAST
R_snub snub_node rect_p 470
C_snub snub_node rect_p 2.2n
.model DFAST D(Is=1e-14 Rs=0.5 N=1 BV=200 Cjo=5p)

* Secondary Schottky rectifier + output filter capacitors
* During MOSFET OFF: energy from L_pri transfers to L_sec
* Voltage on sec node goes positive, D_sec conducts, charges C_out
D_sec sec vout_raw DSCHOTTKY
C_out_main vout_raw iso_gnd 220u ic=14
C_out_hf vout_raw iso_gnd 100n

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 5: LINEAR POST-REGULATOR (Precise 12V Output)
* ==============================================================================
* Zener reference sets base voltage at 12.7V (= 12V + Vbe)
* R_zen limits Zener current from unregulated vout_raw
R_zen vout_raw vbase 100
D_zener iso_gnd vbase DZENER12
.model DZENER12 D(IS=1e-14 BV=12.7 IBV=5m NBV=1 RS=1)

* NPN emitter follower provides low-impedance regulated 12V output
* Vout = Vbase - Vbe = 12.7 - 0.7 = 12.0V
Q1 vout_raw vbase vout QNPN
.model QNPN NPN(BF=200 IS=1e-14 VAF=100 RB=10 RC=1 RE=0.1)

* Output filter on isolated ground domain
C_filt vout iso_gnd 10u ic=12

* ==============================================================================
* STAGE 6: OUTPUT + TELEMETRY LOAD
* ==============================================================================
* Load resistor on ISOLATED output domain
R_load vout iso_gnd {Rload_value}

* Polarity telemetry signal load
R_led pol_out rect_n 10k

* ==============================================================================
* SIMULATION COMMANDS & TRANSIENT MEASUREMENTS
* ==============================================================================
.tran 0 20m 0 1u uic

.meas TRAN V_input AVG V(inp) FROM 10M TO 20M
.meas TRAN V_rectified AVG V(rect_p,rect_n) FROM 10M TO 20M
.meas TRAN V_output AVG V(vout,iso_gnd) FROM 10M TO 20M
.meas TRAN V_polarity AVG V(pol_out,rect_n) FROM 10M TO 20M
.meas TRAN I_load AVG I(R_load) FROM 10M TO 20M
.meas TRAN V_ripple PP V(vout,iso_gnd) FROM 15M TO 20M

.backanno
.end
